{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Hey John! Hope you're doing good. Guess what? I went to a castle during my trip to the UK last Friday and it was unbelievable! The architecture and the history were amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-14fbc658e7a7cc2b4118755d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:02.945700+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "14fbc658e7a7cc2b4118755d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "14fbc658e7a7cc2b4118755d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Tim! That's awesome! Yeah, it was really cool. Oh man, it's been a tough week for me with this injury. But I'm staying positive. How about you? How's your week been?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-8670e1c0283ef9af46022bc5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:07.058938+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8670e1c0283ef9af46022bc5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8670e1c0283ef9af46022bc5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Ouch, bummer about the injury. Hang tight. This week has been swamped with exams for me but I'm plowing through."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-0448e15498eaeb137c5a83de", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:11.206336+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0448e15498eaeb137c5a83de", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0448e15498eaeb137c5a83de", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cheers, Tim. Injury's been rough, but I'm staying positive. How's the exam prep coming? Confident?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-9c8da9d5102b9f4c25501744", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:15.283705+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9c8da9d5102b9f4c25501744", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9c8da9d5102b9f4c25501744", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Exams can be challenging, but I'm putting in my best effort. Feeling optimistic and working diligently! How do you stay motivated during difficult study sessions?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-672c889fde9fd60173c8fd90", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:19.366749+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "672c889fde9fd60173c8fd90", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "672c889fde9fd60173c8fd90", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I visualize my goals and success for focus and motivation. It really helps me stay motivated during tough studying. Do you have any study tricks?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-e9ed1ce745ce80beaabd8cf7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:23.473192+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e9ed1ce745ce80beaabd8cf7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e9ed1ce745ce80beaabd8cf7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: That's cool! I like breaking up my studying into smaller parts. 25 minutes on, then 5 minutes off for something fun. It's less overwhelming and keeps me on track."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-720f8bd3d3bdf64e45f56779", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:27.593337+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "720f8bd3d3bdf64e45f56779", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "720f8bd3d3bdf64e45f56779", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Nice work! Breaking it down into smaller parts is definitely a smart move. I wish you all the best on your exams!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-35be33438b4a7349558e9912", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:31.691640+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "35be33438b4a7349558e9912", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "35be33438b4a7349558e9912", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks! Appreciate your support. I hope your injury heals soon."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-ad2de3e70939d18e660cbe4d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:35.815869+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ad2de3e70939d18e660cbe4d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ad2de3e70939d18e660cbe4d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Sure thing, Tim! Got your back. I hope so too. The doctor said it's not too serious."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-36b0dd22a8f9ee38867053db", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:40.482729+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "36b0dd22a8f9ee38867053db", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "36b0dd22a8f9ee38867053db", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: That's good to hear, I'm glad."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-4fc40761102ec62856b98520", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:44.685278+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4fc40761102ec62856b98520", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4fc40761102ec62856b98520", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I hate not being on the court."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-a42926d9aa7a1fdba0001ddd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:48.826966+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a42926d9aa7a1fdba0001ddd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a42926d9aa7a1fdba0001ddd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: I bet. It's like if I couldn't read due to an injury."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-2102a0d6918e39609e64bc34", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:52.993150+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2102a0d6918e39609e64bc34", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2102a0d6918e39609e64bc34", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I'm pushing on though. Talk soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-4ffa16ca04cfb0d7bbb0e6e3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:19:57.116780+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4ffa16ca04cfb0d7bbb0e6e3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4ffa16ca04cfb0d7bbb0e6e3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Take care! Keep pushing on. Talk soon."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-43/session_18-5b100d662cb9adf727993d04", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:20:01.246509+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5b100d662cb9adf727993d04", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5b100d662cb9adf727993d04", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
